msgid ""
"## 3.权重转换\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 3.权重转换\n"
""

msgid ""
"当前verl已经支持mbridge直接保存hf格式模型权重，无需转换即可使用。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"当前verl已经支持mbridge直接保存hf格式模型权重，无需转换即可使用。\n"
""

msgid ""
"如果模型权重不是hf格式，需要先转换为hf格式，再进行评估。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"如果模型权重不是hf格式，需要先转换为hf格式，再进行评估。\n"
""

msgid ""
"此处参照verl原生[转换方法](../../../../../docs/advance/checkpoint.rst)\n"
""
msgstr ""
"此处参照verl原生[转换方法](../../../../../docs/advance/checkpoint.rst)\n"
""

msgid ""
"## 4.vllm推理评测\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## 4.vllm推理评测\n"
""

msgid ""
"**启动vllm_server服务**\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**启动vllm_server服务**\n"
""

msgid ""
"通过以下命令拉起推理服务端，需要修改的参数：model和tensor-parallel-size。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"通过以下命令拉起推理服务端，需要修改的参数：model和tensor-parallel-size。\n"
""

msgid ""
"model：保存训练后权重转换完的huggingface模型地址；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"model：保存训练后权重转换完的huggingface模型地址；\n"
""

msgid ""
"tensor-parallel-size：张量并行副本数，TP建议和训练时infer的配置保持一致；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"tensor-parallel-size：张量并行副本数，TP建议和训练时infer的配置保持一致；\n"
""

msgid ""
"data-parallel-size：数据并行副本数，DP建议和训练时infer的配置保持一致，默认为1；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"data-parallel-size：数据并行副本数，DP建议和训练时infer的配置保持一致，默认为1；\n"
""

msgid ""
"port：可任意设置空闲端口；\n"
""
msgstr ""
"port：可任意设置空闲端口；\n"
""

msgid ""
"**修改AISBench推理配置启动vllm_client评测**\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**修改AISBench推理配置启动vllm_client评测**\n"
""

msgid ""
"打开推理配置文件 benchmark/ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api/vllm_api_stream_chat.py \n"
""
msgstr ""
"打开推理配置文件 benchmark/ais_bench/benchmark/configs/models/vllm_api/vllm_api_stream_chat.py \n"
""

msgid ""
"host_port需与服务端的port一致，根据模型配置修改max_seq_len和max_out_len\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.models import VLLMCustomAPIChatStream\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.utils.model_postprocessors import extract_non_reasoning_content\n"
""
msgstr ""
"host_port需与服务端的port一致，根据模型配置修改max_seq_len和max_out_len\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.models import VLLMCustomAPIChatStream\n"
"from ais_bench.benchmark.utils.model_postprocessors import extract_non_reasoning_content\n"
""

msgid ""
"另起一个窗口进行评测，开启评测命令：\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"    ais_bench --models vllm_api_stream_chat --datasets math500_gen_0_shot_cot_chat_prompt\n"
"~~~\n"
"## 5.sglang推理评测\n"
"参照 [昇腾 SGLang 最佳实践](../../model_support/examples/ascend_sglang_best_practices.rst)中评测进行"
msgstr ""
"另起一个窗口进行评测，开启评测命令：\n"
"~~~bash\n"
"    ais_bench --models vllm_api_stream_chat --datasets math500_gen_0_shot_cot_chat_prompt\n"
"~~~\n"
"## 5.sglang推理评测\n"
"参照 [昇腾 SGLang 最佳实践](../../model_support/examples/ascend_sglang_best_practices.rst)中评测进行"
